  title="How Much Does 3D Laser Scanning Cost? A 2026 Pricing Guide"
  description="What 3D laser scanning and as-built documentation actually cost in 2026, the five things that drive the price, typical ranges by project type, and how to avoid paying for accuracy you'll never use."
  category="Guide"
  readTime="8 min"
>
  <p>The honest answer to "what does a 3D scan cost" is the one nobody likes: it depends. But it depends on a short, predictable list of things, and once you understand that list you can estimate a project yourself within a reasonable range and spot a quote that's padded or missing scope. This guide lays out the actual cost drivers and real-world ranges, without the vague "call for pricing" runaround.</p>

